:30","sources":[{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20260316001465"},{"date":"20261112","id":"S2","title":"분기보고서 (2026.09)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20261112000504"}],"strengths":[{"evidence":[{"k":"q","src":{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20260316001465"},"text":"영 업 이 익 30,429 25,529 19.2"},{"k":"q","src":{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20260316001465"},"text":"매 출 총 이 익 48,833 43,597 12.0"},{"computed":false,"k":"f","label":"영업이익 · 2025년","src":{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20260316001465"},"value":"304억원"},{"computed":true,"k":"f","label":"영업이익률 · 2025년","src":{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20260316001465"},"value":"8.0%"},{"computed":true,"k":"f","label":"영업이익률 · 2024년","src":{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20260316001465"},"value":"6.6%"}],"text":"2025년 연결 영업이익은 304억원으로 19.2% 늘었다. 영업이익률은 8.0%로 전년 6.6%보다 높아졌다. 매출총이익도 48,833백만원으로 12.0% 늘었다.","title":"2025년 영업이익이 19.2% 늘었다"},{"evidence":[{"k":"q","src":{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20260316001465"},"text":"부 채 비 율 20.3% 20.4%"},{"k":"q","src":{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20260316001465"},"text":"유 동 비 율 372.2% 347.8%"},{"k":"q","src":{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20260316001465"},"text":"장기차입금은 없습니다"},{"k":"q","src":{"date":"20260316","id":"S1","title":"사업보고서 (2025.12)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcp